# Native 4 KiB IPL: F enters floppy selection, digit 1 selects physical B,
# Enter acknowledges selection. Hold F through native IPL initialization;
# the shorter exploratory release at 2 seconds did not enter selection.
# No ROM, RAM or saved-state edits. Invocation-relative ms.
1000 2b
6000 f0
6002 2b
6500 16
7500 f0
7502 16
8000 5a
8500 f0
8502 5a
